{"_note":"评论页顶部一行(v40):左「最新 N 条 · 地区」右「取数于 HH:mm」(时间锚,标准 §4.4)。country 直接读路由 query(ambient scope),rvN/rvAt 来自 reviews.df。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"t","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"6pt","w":"{parent.w}-110pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.latest} $[findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0)] ${@i18n.count} · $[toUpperCase::(findNotEmpty::(${country},--))]","fontSize":"13pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#3B4048|#C4C8CE","maxLines":"1"},{"id":"r","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-106pt","y":"7pt","w":"106pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.at} $[findNotEmpty::(${rvAt},--)]","fontSize":"10.5pt","alignmentH":"2","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"latest":"最新","count":"条","at":"更新于"},"en-US":{"latest":"Latest","count":"reviews","at":"updated"}}}}
